      "type": "list",
      "items": [
        "Use public transport.",
        "Switch off engines at signals.",
        "Use alternative energy sources like solar energy."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "hxcgquc",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "9. Calorific Value"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "ax78j9s",
      "content": "Calorific value is the amount of heat produced by complete combustion of 1 kg of fuel."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "bxhoh8u",
      "content": "Unit: kJ/kg."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "mr7elma",
      "content": "Natural gas has high calorific value."
    },
    {
